    "saint-marina-qadisha.html": {
      "Saint Marina of the Qadisha: The Monk Who Was a Woman": 2,
      "Saint Marina entered a monastery as a boy and lived as a monk in the Qadisha Valley. Her story, her cave, and her relics' return to Lebanon.": 2,
