      "Blessed Estephan Nehme (1889-1938) was a Lebanese Maronite monk of the Lebanese Maronite Order - the order of Saint Charbel. He lived a hidden life of prayer and farm work, was beatified in 2010 after a recognized miracle, and is venerated at Kfifan, where his body is reported to remain intact.": 1,
      "The tomb of Blessed Estephan Nehme at the monastery of Kfifan": 1,
      "The tomb of Blessed Estephan Nehme at the monastery of Saints Cyprian and Justina in Kfifan. Photograph by": 1,
      "Duneir, via Wikimedia Commons": 1,
      ";": 1,
      "CC BY-SA 4.0": 1,
